    "turn_text": "Welcome to the Columbus Metropolitan Club's weekly forum. Founded in 1976 by 13 visionary women leaders, the not-for-profit Columbus Metropolitan Club connects people and ideas through community conversations. I'm Doug Buchanan, CMC's Vice President of Programming. Every Wednesday, CMC hosts a public networking luncheon on the issues that are important to Central Ohio. Tickets and information are available at columbusmetroclub.org. What's happening in Washington and how does it impact Central Ohio? This week we sit down with Congresswoman Joyce Beatty for a wide-ranging one-on-one conversation. Joyce Beatty has represented Ohio's third congressional district since 2013 and is no stranger to changing times in Washington. Our host is veteran CMC moderator Karen Kastler, Chief of the State House News Bureau. Let's join this week's Columbus Metropolitan Club Forum insights from Congresswoman Joyce Beatty.",
