  {
    "episode_id": 77013,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77013.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "I'm thrilled to be here. I'm thrilled to be talking to my U.S. Representative Joyce Beatty. And one of the fun things about being in her district is I used to run into her. And I remember having a spirited conversation in the lighting section of Home Depot one time. But this is a great conversation I think we're going to have today because there's no shortage of things to talk about. So you folks will have a chance to ask questions, but I'm just going to go ahead and get started with something I saw that you wrote on X recently. You wrote, the Trump administration thrives on causing chaos and confusion in your community, but Democrats aren't afraid to fight back against the GOP to protect your benefits, programs, and rights. I think there are a lot of people who are very frustrated with what's been happening. Not only people here in Franklin County, and not only in blue areas, but around the state and around the country. And they want to know what Democrats are specifically doing besides giving speeches and holding rallies. What's happening is there's something happening behind the scenes that we need to look for. What are Democrats really doing about what's been going on?",
