    "turn_text": "evening. And I want to ask you specifically about some things that are happening with universities in Ohio. We just had Senate Bill 1 pass. This is Senate Bill 83 brought back. This is the one that would ban most diversity equity and inclusion programs, ban faculty strikes, among other things. And of course you have the Trump administration now sending a letter to school districts and to universities saying they have 14 days to eliminate race based decision making. Is this legal? How can this happen in 14 days?",
