        "text": "An individual vote can significantly impact political outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Some voters believed Donald Trump would not target them personally.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Rosa Parks' refusal to give up her seat was a pivotal moment in civil rights history.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "I have strong opinions about many individuals involved.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Nonviolent resistance sustained over time can lead to meaningful change.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Those who supported Trump without foreseeing personal consequences deserve the outcome.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
