    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77013.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "Thank you, Congresswoman, for your time with us today. I hear everything that you're sharing in terms of the hope and the margin of error. My question is, what does our last line of defense look like? I mean, what does it look like? Should some of these things not come to fruition? Thank you.",
