    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77013.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "okay? So. Two questions in one. One is, what can ordinary Americans do to re-establish their trust in institutions? And on a more practical level, Sarah Block asks, what is the best media to use to communicate with congressional representatives' calls, only letters? What would you recommend?",
