    "turn_text": "Hi, good afternoon, Congresswoman. I'm here on behalf of my father, who's permanently bedbound, and I took this question down letter by letter in binary form. Being that individuals with disabilities are the most marginalized community when it comes to political participation in the status quo. What is Congress going to do when that limited political participation in the status quo is threatened? And what would you advise everyday Americans with disabilities to be able to participate actively and effectively?",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
