        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Congress has the power and responsibility to address systemic inequities in political access.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "People with disabilities possess legitimate agency and deserve active inclusion in democratic processes.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Everyday Americans with disabilities need guidance and support to participate effectively.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
